{"id":"f22777763c64bcce","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbexpectation.md","title":"Polynomial extension as a Bernoulli expectation","display":"thm-pbexpectation — Polynomial extension as a Bernoulli expectation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbexpectation","aliases":["27-thm-pbexpectation"],"display":"thm-pbexpectation — Polynomial extension as a Bernoulli expectation","depends_on":["[[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]","[[27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3.1","source_statement":"Theorem 13.8","source_printed_pages":"580","source_pdf_pages":"604","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbexpectation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbexpectation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbexpectation — Polynomial extension as a Bernoulli expectation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"196449e4ff7c48d2\" href=\"?note=196449e4ff7c48d2\" title=\"27-df-bernoulliproduct\">27-df-bernoulliproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7ddd9dada5543af\" href=\"?note=c7ddd9dada5543af\" title=\"27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation\">27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"580"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"604"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in U_n\">\\(p\\in U_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_p,\\mathbb E_p\">\\(\\beta_p,\\mathbb E_p\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"196449e4ff7c48d2\" href=\"?note=196449e4ff7c48d2\" title=\"27-df-bernoulliproduct\">27-df-bernoulliproduct</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolExt}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolExt}\\)</span> 及有限插值式（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7ddd9dada5543af\" href=\"?note=c7ddd9dada5543af\" title=\"27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation\">27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)=1,\\qquad\\forall S\\subseteq N\\quad\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)\\prod_{i\\in S}a_i=\\prod_{i\\in S}p_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)=1,\\qquad\\forall S\\subseteq N\\quad\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)\\prod_{i\\in S}a_i=\\prod_{i\\in S}p_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_p[f]=\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb E_p[f]=\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核对 Theorem 13.8 的陈述与证明（印580/PDF604）。质量归一式来自乘积 ∏(p_i+(1-p_i))；乘以单项式后，在 S 内只能选择1坐标，其余坐标的求和因子仍为1。有限交换求和再用规范多项式重构就是书中证明。本笔记同时给出无概率空间依赖的有限版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bernoulliproduct","status":"resolved","id":"196449e4ff7c48d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation","status":"resolved","id":"c7ddd9dada5543af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bernoulliproduct","status":"resolved","id":"196449e4ff7c48d2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$p\\in U_n$；$\\beta_p,\\mathbb E_p$（see [[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]），$\\mathrm{PolExt}$ 及有限插值式（see [[27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation","status":"resolved","id":"c7ddd9dada5543af","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$p\\in U_n$；$\\beta_p,\\mathbb E_p$（see [[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]），$\\mathrm{PolExt}$ 及有限插值式（see [[27-thm-pbmultilinearinterpolation]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_p,\\mathbb E_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolExt}","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)=1,\\qquad\\forall S\\subseteq N\\quad\\sum_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}\\beta_p(a)\\prod_{i\\in S}a_i=\\prod_{i\\in S}p_i.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb E_p[f]=\\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p).","display":true}],"bytes":1598,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-487","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbexpectation|thm-pbexpectation — Polynomial extension as a Bernoulli expectation]]"},{"id":"b88a6e29130bb688","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$U_n,\\mathrm{PolExt},\\beta_p$ 及其期望公式（see [[27-thm-pbexpectation]]）；$\\mathrm{PBArgmin},\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。"}],"outgoing":["196449e4ff7c48d2","c7ddd9dada5543af"]}